    "precautions_bn": "No severe side effects have been observed with Jogaraj guggulu during the clinical practice for the last twenty-five years; however, systematic Phase 1 study with this drug is carried out and general to lerability of Jogaraj guggulu is found good.Maximum to lerable dose is about 9 gm per day.In rare case very high dose than prescribed may lead to stomach irritation, diarrhea, stomatitis & urticaria.",
