    "generic": "Yohimbine Hydrochloride",
    "category": "other",
    "category_bn": "ভিটামিন ও খনিজ পুষ্টি",
    "icon": "✨",
    "target_organ": "Blood & Metabolism / রক্ত ও মেটাবলিজম",
    "organ_key": "blood_immune",
    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Libido।",
    "primary_indication": "Libido",
    "indications": "Yohimbine is indicated in erectile dysfunction, loss of libido & exhaustion.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Yohimbe is a potent alpha-2 adrenoceptor blocker and a weak alpha-1 adrenergic antagonist with some antidopaminergic properties. Yohimbe interacts with adrenoceptors that are selectively stimulated by clonidine, alpha-methylnorepinephrine, tramazoline, guanabenz & guanfacin. It also interacts with compounds that are nonselectively stimulated by norepinephrine and epinephrine. Yohimbe has a modest beneficial effect in the management of erectile dysfunction. Because of the alpha-2 adrenergic blockade, the drug is an effective treatment for sexual disorders such as decreased libido and decreased sexual response, caused by selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors.",
    "dosage_bn": "1 capsule 3 times daily or as advised by the physician",
    "side_effects_bn": "Anxiety states, elevated blood pressure, exanthema, nausea, insomnia, tachycardia, tremor, mania and vomiting.",
    "precautions_bn": "Patients taking Yohimbe should avoid alcohol ingestion",
    "pregnancy_category": "",
