    "indications": "This medication is used to relieve pain, itching, and discomfort from minor skin irritations such as poison ivy, poison oak, and poison sumac. It also helps to dry the oozing and weeping caused by irritation due to these plants.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Calamine has mild astringent and antipruritic actions. Zinc oxide has astringent, soothing and protective properties and is used in to pical preparations for eczema, slight excoriations, wounds and haemorrhoids. It also reflects ultraviolet radiation and can be used as a physical sunscreen.",
