    "name_en": "Calcium Lactate Gluconate + Calcium Carbonate + Vitamin C + Vitamin D3",
    "generic": "Calcium Lactate Gluconate + Calcium Carbonate + Vitamin C + Vitamin D3",
    "category": "analgesic",
    "category_bn": "ব্যথানাশক ও অস্থিসন্ধি",
