    "work_bn": "উচ্চ রক্তচাপ নিয়ন্ত্রণ, হৃদযন্ত্রে রক্ত সঞ্চালন স্বাভাবিক রাখা এবং হার্ট অ্যাটাক ও এনজাইনা বুকের ব্যথা প্রতিরোধে কার্যকর। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Vitamin deficiency)",
    "primary_indication": "Vitamin deficiency",
    "indications": "This preparation is indicated in- • Prevention and treatment of osteoporosis • To maintain strong bone growth • For proper functioning of heart, muscle and nerves • As nutritional supplement • For bone development and regeneration of bone • Pregnancy & lactation This preparation is indicated in- • Prevention and treatment of osteoporosis • To maintain strong bone growth • For proper functioning of heart, muscle and nerves • As nutritional supplement • For bone development and regeneration of bone • Pregnancy & lactation • Deficiency state of Calcium, Vitamin D3, Magnesium, Zinc, Copper, Manganese & Boron",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Nutrition is the most important to prevent osteoporosis and other bone related diseases. Calcium, Magnesium & Vitamin D3 are the macronutrients for bone. Without Vitamin D3 very little Calcium is absorbed. Like Calcium, Magnesium increases bone strength and rigidity. Recent epidemiological studies showed that some micronutrients like Copper, Manganese, Zinc & Boron play an important role in bone health. Deficiency of the micronutrients is noticed in patients with osteoporosis.",
