    "side_effects_bn": "Common side effects of Calcium and Vitamin D3 may include an irregular heartbeat, nausea, dry mouth, weakness, headache, a metallic taste in mouth, muscle or bone pain and drowsiness. Rare side effects are high amount of Calcium in blood, constipation, diarrhoea, loss of appetite.",
    "precautions_bn": "Caution should be taken in patients with renal impairment, sarcoidosis, hypercalcemia and hypercalciuria.",
