    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Vitamin or mineral supplement।",
    "primary_indication": "Vitamin or mineral supplement",
    "indications": "This capsule is indicated for the treatment and prophylaxis of iron, folic acid, zinc, vitamin-B complex and vitamin-C deficiency, especially during pregnancy and lactation.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "• Carbonyl Iron is more effective and safer choice of Iron supplementation as it has higher bioavailability, low to xicity and better Gl to lerance. • Folic acid is required to maintain normal healthy development of the neural tube and is vital for cell division from a single cell to a fully developed baby. • Vitamin B Complex is required for the growth and development of unborn babies. • Vitamin C plays a role In the structure of collagen in the fetal membrane. • Zinc is a critical nutrient for fetal growth & development, central nervous system development & function and ensures better maternal & infant health",
