    "dosage_bn": "Prophylaxis of thromboembolism following cardiac valve replacement: • Adult: 300-600 mg/day in divided doses with an oral anticoagulant. • Child: 5 mg/kg/day in divided doses. Secondary prophylaxis of stroke or transient ischaemic attack: • Adult: As modified-release preparation: 200 mg bid, with or without aspirin.",
