    "how_it_works_bn": "Diphenhydramine possesses antitussive and antihistaminic properties. It relieves cough centrally (brain stem) and treats sneezing, runny nose and allergy (itchy eyes, nose, skin). Levomenthol has decongestant and anti-inflammatory properties which helps soothe cough and reduces congestion and inflammation in the nasal passage and lungs that makes breathing easier.",
