    "indications": "This syrup is indicated as an antitussive, for the relief of persistent, dry, irritating cough and aids restful sleep.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Dextromethorphan Hydrobromide is a non-opioid antitussive drug. It exerts its antitussive activity by acting on the cough center in the medulla oblongata, raising the threshold for the cough reflex. Levomenthol has mild local anesthetic and decongestant properties. Diphenhydramine Hydrochloride possesses antitussive, antihistaminic, anticholinergic properties.",
