    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Insect repellent।",
    "primary_indication": "Insect repellent",
    "indications": "This cream acts against dengue, chikungunya, zika, malaria, and filariasis. It protects up to 8 hours. Ethyl Butylacetylaminopropionate is used for over 30 years.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Ethyl butylacetylaminopropionate (trade name IR3535) is an insect repellent. As ethyl butylacetylaminopropionate is solely a repellent, it has no killing action and does not give rise to selection pressure or development of resistance. It is a colorless and almost odorless oil and is intended to be applied to the skin of humans and animals. It has a broad efficacy against various insects like mosquitoes, ticks, lice, and other bugs. Ethyl butylacetylaminopropionate is safe for use on infants, pregnant and breastfeeding women. It is biodegradable and completely degraded in the environment within a very short time.",
    "dosage_bn": "Apply liberally on exposed areas of the body as often as needed. For best results, reapply every 8 hours.",
    "side_effects_bn": "চিকিৎসকের নির্দেশিত সঠিক মাত্রায় পার্শ্বপ্রতিক্রিয়া বিরল। কোনো জটিলতা দেখা দিলে দ্রুত চিকিৎসকের শরণাপন্ন হোন।",
    "precautions_bn": "Do not apply to eyes, lips, mouth, cuts, and wounds, or irritated skin. This is for external use only.",
