    "precautions_bn": "If extensive areas are treated, the possibility of systemic absorption exists. Systemic absorption of to pical steroids has produced reversible hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal (HPA) axis suppression, manifestations of Cushing's syndrome, hyperglycemia, and glycosuria in some patients. If irritation or sensitivity occurs or infection appears, discontinue use and institute appropriate therapy.",
