    "organ_key": "heart",
    "work_bn": "উচ্চ রক্তচাপ নিয়ন্ত্রণ, হৃদযন্ত্রে রক্ত সঞ্চালন স্বাভাবিক রাখা এবং হার্ট অ্যাটাক ও এনজাইনা বুকের ব্যথা প্রতিরোধে কার্যকর। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Constipation)",
    "primary_indication": "Constipation",
    "indications": "Psyllium Husk is indicated in- • Constipation • Raised levels of cholesterol • Hemorrhoids or piles • Irritable bowel syndrome (IBS) • Reduces blood glucose level Psyllium also provides easy bowel movement with smooth stool. So, it is desirable in patients with anal fissures, colon cancer, post anal & rectal surgery and during pregnancy.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Psyllium Husk is indicated in- • Constipation • Raised levels of cholesterol • Hemorrhoids or piles • Irritable bowel syndrome (IBS) • Reduces blood glucose level Psyllium also provides easy bowel movement with smooth stool. So, it is desirable in patients with anal fissures, colon cancer, post anal & rectal surgery and during pregnancy.",
    "dosage_bn": "Usual dose: 1 spoonful 1-3 times daily or as per doctor's advice. Adults and children over 12 years: 1 spoonful with water 2 times daily or as per doctor's advice. Children 6 to 12 years: 1/2 to 1 spoonful with water depending on age and size, in the morning and at bedtime or as per doctor's advice. Children below 6 years: Not recommended except as directed by the physician. An additional glass of water is helpful after taking this gel.",
