    "work_bn": "উচ্চ রক্তচাপ নিয়ন্ত্রণ, হৃদযন্ত্রে রক্ত সঞ্চালন স্বাভাবিক রাখা এবং হার্ট অ্যাটাক ও এনজাইনা বুকের ব্যথা প্রতিরোধে কার্যকর। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Stroke)",
    "primary_indication": "Stroke",
    "indications": "Lacidipine is indicated for the treatment of hypertension either alone or in combination with other antihypertensive agents, including ß-blockers, diuretics, ACE-inhibitors etc.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Lacidipine inhibits the influx of calcium into smooth muscle cells by the competitive inhibition of voltage-dependent calcium 'L' channels. This action results in the inhibition of the effects triggered by the influx of calcium into the cells, such as the activation of the contractile proteins in smooth muscle.",
    "dosage_bn": "The recommended initial dose of Lacidipine is 2 mg once daily. The dose may be increased to 4 mg and then, if necessary, to 6 mg after 3 to 4 weeks. Lacidipine should be taken preferably in the morning.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Lacidipine is generally well to lerated. Some individuals may experience minor side effects like flushing, palpitation, edema, headache, dizziness, rarely gastro-intestinal disturbances, gum hyperplasia, mood disturbances, asthenia, polyuria, muscle cramps, skin rash etc.",
    "precautions_bn": "Cardiac conduction abnormalities, poor cardiac reserves, hepatic impairment, withdraw if ischemic pain occurs shortly after initiating treatment or if cardiogenic shock develops, avoid grape fruit juice.",
