    "work_bn": "রক্তচাপ নিয়ন্ত্রণ করে এবং ডায়াবেটিক রোগীদের কিডনি সুরক্ষা দিতে অ্যাঞ্জিওটেনসিন ব্লকার হিসেবে কাজ করে।",
    "primary_indication": "Stroke",
    "indications": "Hypertension: Losartan Potassium is indicated for the treatment of hypertension. It may be used alone or in combination with other antihypertensive agents (eg. thiazide diuretics). Renal Protection in Type-2 Diabetic Patients with Proteinuria: Losartan Potassium Hypertension: Losartan Potassium is indicated for the treatment of hypertension. It may be used alone or in combination with other antihypertensive agents (eg. thiazide diuretics). Renal Protection in Type-2 Diabetic Patients with Proteinuria: Losartan Potassium is indicated to delay the progression of renal disease in hypertensive type-2 diabetics with proteinuria, defined as urinary albumin to creatinine ratio >300 mg/g.",
