    "how_it_works_bn": "This preparation is a clinically proven antiseptic mouthwash that provides you complete care for healthier mouth with around-the-clock protection against bacteria and plaque. Your mouth stays cleaner, fresher and healthier. • 24 hours protection against plaque, gingivitis and gum disease • Fights against germs that cause bad breath • Kills germs between teeth and keeps teeth cleaner & brighter",
