    "id": "med_1142",
    "name_en": "Moxifloxacin Hydrochloride (Injection)",
    "generic": "Moxifloxacin Hydrochloride (Injection)",
    "category": "antibiotic",
    "category_bn": "অ্যান্টিবায়োটিক ও সংক্রমণ",
