    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Wounds।",
    "primary_indication": "Wounds",
    "indications": "Nitrofurazone is indicated in the infectious conditions of the skin such as burns, wounds, ulcers, skin infections and skin grafting.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Nitrofurazone is a broad spectrum to pical antibacterial agent indicated for the treatment of mixed skin infections of superficial wounds and diseases of the skin.",
