    "icon": "🍽️",
    "target_organ": "Stomach / পাকস্থলী",
    "organ_key": "stomach",
    "work_bn": "গ্যাস্ট্রিক আলসার, বুকজ্বালা ও এসিডিটি কমাতে কার্যকর প্রথম সারির প্রোটন পাম্প ইনহিবিটর।",
    "primary_indication": "Zollinger-Ellison syndrome",
    "indications": "Omeprazole is indicated for the treatment of- • Gastric and duodenal ulcer • NSAID-associated duodenal and gastric ulcer • As prophylaxis in patients with a history of NSAID-associated duodenal and gastric ulcer • Gastro-esophageal reflux disease • Long-term management of acid reflux disease Omeprazole is indicated for the treatment of- • Gastric and duodenal ulcer • NSAID-associated duodenal and gastric ulcer • As prophylaxis in patients with a history of NSAID-associated duodenal and gastric ulcer • Gastro-esophageal reflux disease • Long-term management of acid reflux disease • Acid-related dyspepsia • Severe ulcerating reflux esophagitis • Prophylaxis of acid aspiration during general anesthesia • Zollinger-Ellison syndrome • Helicobacter pylori-induced peptic ulcer.",
