    "organ_key": "eyes_ears",
    "work_bn": "চোখের সংক্রমণ, চুলকানি, অতিরিক্ত শুষ্কতা দূর এবং দৃষ্টিশক্তি সুরক্ষা ও চোখের উচ্চচাপ কমাতে নির্দেশিত। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Surgical aid in the anterior segment)",
    "primary_indication": "Surgical aid in the anterior segment",
    "indications": "Prednisolone eye drops is indicated for the treatment of steroid-responsive inflammation of the palpebral and bulbar conjunctiva, cornea and anterior segment of the globe.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Prednisolone decreases inflammation by inhibition of migration of polymorphonuclear leukocytes and reversal of increased capillary permeability. It suppresses the immune system by reducing the activity and production of the lymphocytes and eosinophils.",
