    "primary_indication": "Vitamin or mineral deficiency",
    "indications": "Total diet replacement or supplement in anorexia, illness, convalescence, pregnancy, lactation, old age, weight loss, fatigue, pre- & post-surgical conditions, oral pathology, cancer, transition from TPN & tube feeding for adults & older persons. Specialized nutrition with fiber for diabetic patients.",
