    "work_bn": "চোখের সংক্রমণ, চুলকানি, অতিরিক্ত শুষ্কতা দূর এবং দৃষ্টিশক্তি সুরক্ষা ও চোখের উচ্চচাপ কমাতে নির্দেশিত। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Lens opacification)",
    "primary_indication": "Lens opacification",
    "indications": "This eye drops is used for the treatment of lens opacification.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Anhydrous Sodium Succinate (intermediate substance) promotes the production of ATP Cytochrome C is involved in the oxidative phosphorylation for synthesizing ATP from ADP. Adenosine plays essential role in producing energy required for the vital function of the life lens e.g. the biosynthesis of glutathione, intermembrane active transport of ions and amino acid, the synthesis of DNA, RNA and nucleic acids. Nicotinamide is said to be involved in the process of creating ATP. NADPH plays a major role in protecting cell against oxidizing agents and from free radicals by maintaining glutathione in its reduced form.",
