    "indications": "Sodium fluoride is an antiseptic & anticavity mouthwash which- • Restores enamel to strengthen teeth • Protects teeth from cavity • Helps to prevent to oth decay • Controls tartar that can discolor teeth • whitens teeth safety",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Sodium fluoride is a cariostatic agent that is used to prevent dental caries. It can also be used as a source of fluoride in to tal parenteral nutrition.",
    "dosage_bn": "Rinse (gargle) with fall strength Sodium fluoride for 30 seconds with 20 ml (with the help of supplied cup) two times daily (morning and evening). Do not swallow. Don’t eat or drink within 30 minutes after rinsing with Sodium fluoride restoring.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Hypersensitivity reactions, rash, nausea, vomiting. Products containing stannous fluoride may cause teeth staining.",
    "precautions_bn": "Prolonged treatment with large amounts of fluoride may result in dental fluorosis and osseous changes; do not exceed recommended dosage. Renal impairment. Pregnancy.",
