    "icon": "👂",
    "target_organ": "Ears & ENT / কান ও নাক-কান-গলা",
    "organ_key": "eyes_ears",
    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Minor cuts।",
    "primary_indication": "Minor cuts",
    "indications": "First aid to help prevent skin infection in minor cuts, scrapes, and burns.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Tetracycline passively diffuses through porin channels in the bacterial membrane and reversibly binds to the 30S ribosomal subunit, preventing binding of tRNA to the mRNA-ribosome complex, and thus interfering with protein synthesis.",
    "dosage_bn": "Clean the affected area. Apply a small amount of this product (an amount equal to the surface area of the tip of a finger) on the area 1 to 3 times daily. May be covered with a sterile bandage.",
