    "primary_indication": "Dental hypersensitivity",
    "indications": "This to othpaste is indicated in- • Faster relief from dental hypersensitivity. • Sensitivity repair • Teeth strengthening • Gum protection • Teeth whitening • Total oral hygiene • Plaque control • Enamel protection • Extra fresh breath",
