    "side_effects_bn": "CNS excitation may be followed by depression. Hypotension, bradycardia, arrhythmias and cardiac arrest; methaemoglobinaemia; seizures, restlessness, dizziness. Hypersensitivity. Prolonged block.\\nPotentially Fatal: Cardiac and sudden respiratory arrest.",
