    "organ_key": "heart",
    "work_bn": "উচ্চ রক্তচাপ নিয়ন্ত্রণ, হৃদযন্ত্রে রক্ত সঞ্চালন স্বাভাবিক রাখা এবং হার্ট অ্যাটাক ও এনজাইনা বুকের ব্যথা প্রতিরোধে কার্যকর। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Heartburn, Dyspepsia, Peptic ulcers, Benign gastric and duodenal ulceration, Gastro-oesophageal reflux disease, Zollinger-Ellison syndrome, Pancreatic insufficiency)",
    "primary_indication": "Heartburn, Dyspepsia, Peptic ulcers, Benign gastric and duodenal ulceration, Gastro-oesophageal reflux disease, Zollinger-Ellison syndrome, Pancreatic insufficiency",
    "indications": "Heartburn, Dyspepsia, Peptic ulcers, Benign gastric and duodenal ulceration, Gastro-oesophageal reflux disease, Zollinger-Ellison syndrome, Pancreatic insufficiency",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Cimetidine competitively inhibits histamine at H2-receptors of the gastric parietal cells resulting in decreased gastric acid secretion, gastric volume and hydrogen ion concentration. It is also used in patients w/ pancreatic insufficiency to reduce the breakdown of pancreatic enzyme supplements.",
    "dosage_bn": "Intravenous\\nBenign gastric and duodenal ulceration\\nAdult: Intermittent infusion: 300 mg 6-8 hrly infused over 15-20 min. Max: 2400 mg/day. Continuous infusion: 37.5 mg/hr (900 mg/day). A 150 mg IV loading dose may be given in patients requiring rapid elevation of gastric pH.\\n\\nZollinger-Ellison syndrome\\nAdult: Intermittent infusion: 300 mg 6-8 hrly infused over 15-20 min. Max: 2400 mg/day. Continuous infusion: 37.5 mg/hr (900 mg/day). A 150 mg IV loading dose may be given in patients requiring rapid elevation of gastric pH.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Diarrhoea, dizziness, tiredness, rash, headache, CNS disturbances, arthralgia, myalgia, gynaecomastia, alopoecia, blood dyscrasias, nephritis, hepatitis, pancreatitis, granulocytopenia, hypersensitivity reactions.",
    "precautions_bn": "Impaired renal and hepatic function. Age >50 yr; CV impairment. Pregnancy.",
    "pregnancy_category": "B",
    "brands": "G Cimetidine",
