    "target_organ": "Blood & Metabolism / রক্ত ও মেটাবলিজম",
    "organ_key": "blood_immune",
    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Nutritional supplement।",
    "primary_indication": "Nutritional supplement",
    "indications": "Nutritional supplement",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Iron: Essential component in the formation of hemoglobin; adequate amounts of iron are necessary for effective erythropoiesis; also serves as a cofactor of several essential enzymes, including cytochromes that are involved in electron transport. Replacement of iron stores found in hemoglobin, myoglobin, and enzymes; works to transport oxygen via hemoglobin.\\nFolic acid: Required for nucleoprotein synthesis and the maintenance of normal erythropoiesis; folic acid is converted in the liver and plasma to its metabolically active form, tetrahydrofolic acid, by dihydrofolate reductase; prevents neural tube defects in women of childbearing potential and higher doses required during pregnancy.\\nCopper: Cofactor in many enzymes, including ceruloplasmin; involved in formation of iron carrier protein, transferrin. Helps maintain normal rates of red and white blood cell formation and helps prevent development of deficiency symptoms. \\nIodine: Required for thyroid hormone synthesis; component of thyroid hormones (T3 & T4).",
    "dosage_bn": "One tablet daily or as recommended by the physician.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Generally well tolerated.",
    "precautions_bn": "Folic acid in doses above 0.1 mg daily may obscure pernicious anemia in that hematological remission can occur while neurological manifestations remain progressive.",
