    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Atypical pneumonia, Hyponatraemia।",
    "primary_indication": "Atypical pneumonia, Hyponatraemia",
    "indications": "Atypical pneumonia, Hyponatraemia",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Demeclocycline inhibits protein synthesis by binding w/ the 30S and possibly the 50S ribosomal subunits of susceptible bacteria. It may also cause alterations in the cytoplasmic membrane. It inhibits the action of antidiuretic hormone (ADH) in patients w/ chronic syndrome of inappropriate antidiuretic hormone secretion (SIADH).",
    "dosage_bn": "Adult: PO Susceptible infections 150 mg 4 times/day. Atypical pneumonia 300 mg 3 times/day. Chronic hyponatraemia associated w/ SIADH Initial: 900-1,200 mg/day in divided doses. Maintenance: 600-900 mg/day in divided doses.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Photosensitivity. Reversible nephrogenic diabetes insipidus. Permanent staining of teeth; nausea; rash; GI upsets; dysphagia; enterocolitis; anogenital inflammation (moniliasis). Hypersensitivity; haemolytic anaemia, thrombocytopenia, neutropenia and eosinophilia; raised blood urea and liver enzymes.\\nPotentially Fatal: Anaphylaxis (rare).",
    "precautions_bn": "Children <12 yr; SLE; renal or hepatic disease.",
