    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Pneumonia, Endocarditis, Impetigo, Cellulitis, Septic Arthritis, Surgical Prophylaxis, Otitis externa, Staphylococcal skin infections, Folliculitis, Boils, Carbuncles, Mastitis, Osteomyelitis, Throat infections, Streptococcus Septicaemia।",
    "primary_indication": "Pneumonia, Endocarditis, Impetigo, Cellulitis, Septic Arthritis, Surgical Prophylaxis, Otitis externa, Staphylococcal skin infections, Folliculitis, Boils, Carbuncles, Mastitis, Osteomyelitis, Throat infections, Streptococcus Septicaemia",
