    "name_en": "Guaiphenesin + Pseudoephedrine Hydrochloride + Triprolidine Hydrochloride",
    "generic": "Guaiphenesin + Pseudoephedrine Hydrochloride + Triprolidine Hydrochloride",
    "category": "respiratory",
    "category_bn": "শ্বাসতন্ত্র ও হাঁপানি",
