    "side_effects_bn": "Dry cough, headache, bradycardia, dizziness, asthenia, hypokalaemia and orthostatic hypotension. GI effects such as constipation, dry mouth, nausea, epigastric pain, anorexia, abdominal pain and taste disturbance.",
