    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Iron-deficiency anemia।",
    "primary_indication": "Iron-deficiency anemia",
    "indications": "Iron-deficiency anemia",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Iron polymaltose is a water soluble, macro-molecular complex of iron (III) hydroxide and isomaltose. It is used in the treatment of iron-deficiency anaemia.",
    "dosage_bn": "Dosage and duration of therapy are dependent upon the extent of iron deficiency and should be taken as directed by the physician.\\n\\nAdults: 10 ml once or twice daily\\nChildren (6 - 12 years): 10 ml daily\\nChildren (2 - 6 years): 5 ml daily\\nPremature infants & Infants: 3.33 mg of elemental iron/kg body weight (0.06 ml drops/kg body weight) daily.",
