    "primary_indication": "Congestive heart failure,Diabetic nephropathy,Intermittent claudication,Kidney disease,Chronic Fatigue Syndrome,Heart Diseases,High Cholesterol,Dementia and memory impairment,Down Syndrome,Male infertility",
