    "dosage_bn": "Adults and Children 12 years of age and over: PO: loratadine 5 mg and pseudoephedrine sulfate 120 mg: 1 tab twice daily. \\nLoratadine 10 mg and pseudoephedrine sulfate 240 mg: 1 tab once daily.\\n(Safety and effectiveness of this drug in children below the age of 12 years have not been established).",
