    "indications": "Rheumatoid arthritis, Osteoarthritis, Post-herpetic neuralgia, Anogenital pruritus, Congestion, Muscle aches, Sprains, Cold, Catarrh, Stiff neck, Low back pain, Spondylitis. Peripheral neuralgias: Diabetic neuropathy, Trigeminal neuralgia, Post surgical pains, Headache, Backache, Sprains, Rheumatism Strains, Tendonitis, Leg cramps",
