    "primary_indication": "Dry eye",
    "indications": "Dry eye",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Polyethylene Glycol & Propylene Glycol are eye lubricants. Eye lubricants keep the eye moist, help to protect the eye from injury and infection, and decrease symptoms of dry eye such as burning, irritation and feeling as if something is in the eye. It is scientifically formulated to shield eyes from dry eye discomfort so that eyes feel moist and refreshed longer.",
