    "name_en": "Sodium Bicarbonate 6.6% + Sodium Chloride 3.1% + Highly purified water (Haemodialysis solutions)",
    "generic": "Sodium Bicarbonate 6.6% + Sodium Chloride 3.1% + Highly purified water (Haemodialysis solutions)",
