    "dosage_bn": "Adult: PO HTN; Benign prostatic hyperplasia Initial: 1 mg at bedtime, gradually increase if needed. Maintenance: 2-10 mg once daily (HTN); 5-10 mg once daily (benign prostatic hyperplasia). Max: 20 mg/day in 1-2 divided doses.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Orthostatic hypotension, syncope, dizziness, fatigue, somnolence, peripheral oedema, headache, nasal congestion, nausea, blurred vision, postural hypotension, palpitations, priapism.",
