    "target_organ": "Immune System / রোগপ্রতিরোধ ব্যবস্থা",
    "organ_key": "blood_immune",
    "work_bn": "শরীরের অভ্যন্তরীণ বা বাহ্যিক ক্ষতিকর ব্যাকটেরিয়াজনিত জীবাণু ধ্বংস ও মারাত্মক সংক্রমণ প্রতিরোধে ব্যবহৃত অ্যান্টিবায়োটিক। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Tinea pedis, Tinea cruris, Tinea corporis, Dermatophytosis, Nail infections, Cutaneous candidiasis and Pityriasis versicolor)",
    "primary_indication": "Tinea pedis, Tinea cruris, Tinea corporis, Dermatophytosis, Nail infections, Cutaneous candidiasis and Pityriasis versicolor",
    "indications": "Tinea pedis, Tinea cruris, Tinea corporis, Dermatophytosis, Nail infections, Cutaneous candidiasis and Pityriasis versicolor",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Terbinafine causes fungal cell death by inhibiting squalene epoxidase, the main enzyme in sterol biosynthesis, resulting in ergosterol deficiency within fungal cell walls. It has fungicidal activity against dermatophytes and some yeast.",
    "dosage_bn": "Dermatophytosis\\nAdult: Apply cream/solution/spray once or bid. 1-2 wk to treat tinea corporis and tinea cruris; 1-wk course is for tinea pedis; 2-wk course in cutaneous candidiasis and pityriasis versicolor",
    "side_effects_bn": "Anorexia, nausea, abdominal pain, taste disturbances, diarrhoea, rash, urticaria.\\nPotentially Fatal: Liver failure, Stevens-Johnson syndrome, neutropaenia.",
    "precautions_bn": "Preexisting liver or renal impairment, pregnancy. Perform liver function tests prior to oral therapy.",
    "pregnancy_category": "B",
    "brands": "Anpar, Derbicil, Derfin, Infud, Lamisil, Mycofin, Mycofree, Tarmider",
