    "work_bn": "চোখের সংক্রমণ, চুলকানি, অতিরিক্ত শুষ্কতা দূর এবং দৃষ্টিশক্তি সুরক্ষা ও চোখের উচ্চচাপ কমাতে নির্দেশিত। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Keratoconjunctivitis and recurrent epithelial keratitis due to herpes simplex viruses)",
    "primary_indication": "Keratoconjunctivitis and recurrent epithelial keratitis due to herpes simplex viruses",
    "indications": "Keratoconjunctivitis and recurrent epithelial keratitis due to herpes simplex viruses",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Trifluridine interferes with the synthesis of viral DNA following phosphorylation. It is active against HSV types 1 and 2 and vaccinia virus.",
    "dosage_bn": "Adult: Ophth As 1% soln: Instill 1 drop 2 hrly, up to 9 times/day till complete re-epithelialization, then reduce to 1 drop 4 hrly during wake hr to a min of 5 drops/day for 7 days. \\n\\nRe-evaluate if there is no improvement after 7 days or complete re-epithelialization has not occurred after 14 days.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Transient burning or stinging upon instillation, irritation, hyperemia, palpebral oedema, dry eye, superficial punctate keratopathy, epithelial keratopathy, hypersensitivity reaction and increased intraocular pressure.",
    "precautions_bn": "Pregnancy; child <6 yr. Use under close supervision of ophthalmologist. Continuous admin >21 days to be avoided due to risk of ocular toxicity.",
