    "primary_indication": "Assisted reproductive technologies, In-vitro fertilization",
    "indications": "Assisted reproductive technologies, In-vitro fertilization",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Cetrorelix, a synthetic decapeptide analog of naturally occurring gonadorelin, is a gonadorelin antagonist. It competitively blocks gonadorelin receptors on the anterior piyuitary gonadotroph and the subsequent transduction pathway, inducing a rapid, reversible suppression of gonadotrophin secretion.",
