    "side_effects_bn": "Mild and transient reactions at Inj site, nausea, headache, ovarian hyperstimulation syndrome, systemic hypersensitivity reactions.",
    "precautions_bn": "Women with active allergic conditions or a history of allergies; childn; elderly >65 yrs",
