    "generic": "Diphtheria Toxoid 30IU + Tetanus Toxoid 60IU + Pertusis + Hepatitis B (Vaccine)",
    "category": "digestive",
    "category_bn": "পরিপাক ও এসিডিটি",
    "icon": "🫀",
    "target_organ": "Liver / যকৃত ও লিভার",
    "organ_key": "liver",
    "work_bn": "যকৃতের কর্মক্ষমতা সুরক্ষা, বাইল অ্যাসিডের ভারসাম্য ও হেপাটিক জটিলতা নিরাময়ে নির্দেশিত। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Diphtheria, Tetanus, Pertussis & Hepatitis B in infants.)",
    "primary_indication": "Diphtheria, Tetanus, Pertussis & Hepatitis B in infants.",
    "indications": "Diphtheria, Tetanus, Pertussis & Hepatitis B in infants.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Vaccine is used for the active immunisation of diphtheria, tetanus and pertussis in children from 6 wk to 6 yr of age. Production of specific antibodies to tetanus, diphtheria, and pertusis (active immunity). Conveys active immunity via stimulation of production of endogenously produced antibodies",
    "dosage_bn": "Deep IM inj Primary vaccination 3 doses of 0.5 mL w/in the 1st 6 mth of life at intervals of at least 4 wk. \\nBooster dose: Administer during the 2nd yr of life.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Redness, swelling & severe pain at inj site. Unusual crying, drowsiness, irritability, GI symptoms, feeding problems & fever. Collapse or shock-like state.",
    "precautions_bn": "Previous reaction to DTP vaccine; family history of convulsions, SIDS; bleeding dis­orders; immunosuppression /deficiency; preg­nancy, lactation. Postpone vaccination in patients w/ acute severe febrile illness. Should be administered SC in patients w/ thrombocytopenia or bleeding disorders. Syncope, risk of apnea. Temp >40°C, persistent crying lasting >3 hr & collapse or shock-like state w/in 48 hrs; convulsions w/ or w/o fever w/in 3 days. High incidence of pertussis. Childn w/ progressive neurological disorders including infantile spasms, uncontrolled epilepsy or progressive encephalopathy. Consider potential risk of apnea & need for resp monitoring for 48-72 hr to very premature infants (>28 wk of gestation) particularly those w/ previous history of resp immaturity.",
    "pregnancy_category": "C",
    "brands": "Tritanrix HB",
