    "how_it_works_bn": "Fosinopril, a prodrug of fosinoprilat, competitively inhibits ACE from converting angiotensin I to angiotensin II resulting in decreased levels of angiotensin II which causes increased plasma renin activity and reduced aldosterone secretion. It also reduces Na and water retention. This promotes vasodilation and BP reduction.",
