    "side_effects_bn": "Dizziness, orthostatic hypotension, palpitation, headache, weakness, fatigue, hyperkalaemia, chest pain, musculoskeletal pain, dry cough, nausea, vomiting, dyspepsia, diarrhoea.\\nPotentially Fatal: Cerebrovascular accident, rhythm disturbances, palpitations, hypotension, syncope, rashes, oedema, hypersensitivity reactions, angioedema.",
    "precautions_bn": "Severely impaired renal function; hyperkalaemia, hypovolaemia, collagen vascular diseases, valvular stenosis; before, during or immediately after anaesthesia, unilateral renal artery stenosis.",
