    "target_organ": "General Physiology / সার্বিক শারীরবৃত্ত",
    "organ_key": "general",
    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Meningococcal meningitis and septicaemia।",
    "primary_indication": "Meningococcal meningitis and septicaemia",
    "indications": "Meningococcal meningitis and septicaemia",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Meningococcal serogroup A, C, Y and W-135 capsular polysaccharide antigens individually conjugated to diphtheria toxoid protein carrier.\\n\\nThese products convey active immunity via stimulation of production of endogenously produced antibodies.\\n",
    "dosage_bn": "The recommended dose for vaccines in all age groups is 0.5mL, administered as a single dose. Administer a 0.5 mL dose vaccine by subcutaneous injection.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Local and systemic adverse reactions especially febrile reactions may be encountered more frequently\\nin children than in adults.Irritability, drowsiness, headache, gastrointestinal symptoms e.g. nau\\nsea, vomiting and diarrhoea, local axillary lymphadenopathy. Very common: erythema, induration, tenderness, pain and redness at the injection site, fatigue, malaise.\\n\\n",
    "precautions_bn": "Vaccine is for subcutaneous use only, and should under no circumstances be administered\\nintravascularly or by intradermal injection.",
