    "icon": "🫘",
    "target_organ": "Kidneys & Bladder / কিডনি ও মূত্রথলি",
    "organ_key": "kidneys",
    "work_bn": "কিডনি ও মূত্রথলির কার্যক্ষমতা রক্ষা, প্রস্রাবের স্বাভাবিক প্রবাহ নিশ্চিতকরণ এবং প্রোস্টেট উপসর্গ নিরাময়ে ব্যবহৃত হয়। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Uncomplicated urinary tract infections (including cystitis), Uncomplicated urethral and cervical gonorrhea, Prostatitis, Gastroenteritis)",
    "primary_indication": "Uncomplicated urinary tract infections (including cystitis), Uncomplicated urethral and cervical gonorrhea, Prostatitis, Gastroenteritis",
    "indications": "Uncomplicated urinary tract infections (including cystitis), Uncomplicated urethral and cervical gonorrhea, Prostatitis, Gastroenteritis",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Norfloxacin inhibits the action of DNA gyrase in DNA replication, transcription, repair, recombination and transposition.",
    "dosage_bn": "Adult: PO Uncomplicated gonorrhoea 800 mg once daily. Susceptible infections 400 mg twice daily. Duration: Chronic bacterial prostatitis: 28 days; Complicated UTI: 10-21 days; Gastroenteritis: 3-5 days; \\n\\nUncomplicated UTI caused by susceptible Escherichia coli, Klebsiella pneumoniae, roteus mirabilis species: 3 days; Uncomplicated UTI caused by other susceptible bacteria: 7-10 days. Chronic relapsing UTI 400 mg twice daily, up to 12 wk, may reduce to once daily if adequate suppression w/in 1st 4 wk. \\n\\nRenal impairment:\\nCrCl (ml/min)\\t\\n<30\\t400 mg once daily",
