    "organ_key": "heart",
    "work_bn": "উচ্চ রক্তচাপ নিয়ন্ত্রণ, হৃদযন্ত্রে রক্ত সঞ্চালন স্বাভাবিক রাখা এবং হার্ট অ্যাটাক ও এনজাইনা বুকের ব্যথা প্রতিরোধে কার্যকর। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Resp distress syndrome (RDS) in premature infants.)",
    "primary_indication": "Resp distress syndrome (RDS) in premature infants.",
    "indications": "Resp distress syndrome (RDS) in premature infants.",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Natural bovine pulmonary surfactant; replaces deficient endogenous lung surfactant in neonates with respiratory distress syndrome.\\n\\nSurfactant prevents the alveoli from collapsing during expiration by lowering surface tension between alveolar surfaces and air.",
    "dosage_bn": "4 mL/kg birth wt(100 mg of phospholipids/kg birth wt) intratracheally up to 4 doses in 1st 48 hr. Doses should not be given more frequently than 6 hrly. To be administered as soon as possible. Prevention in premature infant <1250 g birthwt or w/ evidence of surfactant deficiency Preferably w/in 15 mins of birth. Rescue Preferably by 8 hr of age.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Transient bradycardia. O2 desaturation, endotracheal tube reflux & blockage, pallor, vasoconstriction, hypotension, HTN, hypocarbia, hypercarbia & apnea.",
