    "work_bn": "চোখের সংক্রমণ, চুলকানি, অতিরিক্ত শুষ্কতা দূর এবং দৃষ্টিশক্তি সুরক্ষা ও চোখের উচ্চচাপ কমাতে নির্দেশিত। (মূল নির্দেশিকা: Dry, Irritated eyes)",
    "primary_indication": "Dry, Irritated eyes",
    "indications": "Dry, Irritated eyes",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Polyvinyl alcohol, a nonionic surfactant, is used as a stabilising agent, lubricant and as an agent to increase viscosity in pharmaceutical manufacturing. In eye preparations, polyvinyl alcohol is used to increase the viscosity and thereby prolonging contact time of the active ingredient with the eye. It is often found in artificial tears preparations for dry eye and in contact lens solutions.",
    "dosage_bn": "Adult: Ophth As 0.5-1.4% soln w/ or w/o povidone: Instill 1-2 drops up to 3- 4 times/day when needed.",
    "side_effects_bn": "Mild stinging/burning/irritation in the eye; temporary blurred vision.",
