    "generic": "Sodium Chloride + Potassium Chloride + Calcium chloride + Magnesium Chloride + Sodium Acetate + Sodium Citrate + Sodium Hydroxide + Hydrochloric Acid (Balanced Salt Solution)",
    "category": "analgesic",
