    "dosage_bn": "Adults: Inhalation Asthma prophylaxis As dry powd/ nebulising soln: 20 mg 4 times/day or as aerosol:10 mg 4 times/day, up to 6-8 times/day if needed, reduced to 5 mg 4 times/day once asthma has stabilised. Additional doses may be taken before exercise.",
