    "work_bn": "চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিম্নলিখিত সমস্যার চিকিৎসায় কার্যকর: Acne; Hyperkeratotic and scaling skin conditions।",
    "primary_indication": "Acne; Hyperkeratotic and scaling skin conditions",
    "indications": "Acne; Hyperkeratotic and scaling skin conditions",
    "how_it_works_bn": "Salicylic acid has a potent keratolytic action and a slight antiseptic action when applied topically. It softens and destroys the stratum corneum by increasing endogenous hydration which causes the horny layer of the skin to swell, soften, and then desquamate. At high concentrations, salicylic acid has a caustic effect. It also possesses weak antifungal and antibacterial activity.",
    "dosage_bn": "Adult: Topical Acne; Hyperkeratotic and scaling skin conditions As 2-6% preparation: Apply >3 times/day. Warts and calluses As 60% preparation: Apply as directed.",
