    "dosage_bn": "Apply on the area exposed to sunlight (such as face, neck & body) atleast 30 min before exposure and whenever necessary. Massage on to skin until absorbed.\\n\\nTo ensure maximum protection, we recommend repeating the application every two hours after continuous exposure to the sun and after swimming, physical exercise (sweat or dry with towel).",
